If you sacrifice a unicorn of an altar's alignment at that altar, that
altar's god gives you the works.  Luck-blast, wisdom drain, wisdom 
abuse, possibly guardians (angels/elementals/demons as appropriate).


(lawful player)           Unicorn
Altar     |      White          Grey            Black
----------+--------------------------------------------------
White     |      MAJOR OUCH     GOOD            GOOD
Grey      |      convert self   OUCH            convert altar
Black     |      convert self   convert altar   OUCH


(neutral player)          Unicorn
Altar     |      White          Grey            Black
----------+--------------------------------------------------
White     |      OUCH           convert self    convert altar
Grey      |      GOOD           MAJOR OUCH      GOOD
Black     |      convert altar  convert self    OUCH


(chaotic player)          Unicorn
Altar     |      White          Grey            Black
----------+--------------------------------------------------
White     |      OUCH           convert altar   convert self
Grey      |      convert altar  OUCH            convert self
Black     |      GOOD           GOOD            MAJOR OUCH


